        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: annual Monster Energy NASCAR Cup Series race, Virginia 529 College Savings 250\n- Places: Richmond International Raceway, Richmond, Virginia\n- Organizations: Monster Energy NASCAR Cup Series, Diageo\n- Products: sponsoring brand\n\nFacts:\n- An annual Monster Energy NASCAR Cup Series stock car race is held at Richmond International Raceway in Richmond, Virginia.\n- The annual race is the second of two spring races held at Richmond International Raceway.\n- From 2007 to 2011, the first of the two spring races was sponsored by a brand owned by Diageo.\n- The Virginia 529 College Savings 250 takes place at Richmond International Raceway the day before the annual race.",
